---
sitemap: false
---
{%- comment -%}
  Search index for the Blog page: one entry per post, written when the site is built.
  /assets/js/blog-search.js downloads it only when a visitor starts searching or picks a topic.
    type    "exercise" or "article"
    slugs   the post's topics as web-safe words, joined with |
    text    the whole post plus the exercise questions and explanations, used for matching
    card    the finished list entry, reused as it is to show the results
  Only if the list ever becomes too heavy (many hundreds of long posts): add  | truncate: 20000, ''  after
  normalize_whitespace on the "text" line below, which keeps about the first 3,000 words of each post.
{%- endcomment -%}
[
{%- for post in site.posts -%}
  {%- if post.exercise -%}{%- assign kind = 'exercise' -%}{%- else -%}{%- assign kind = 'article' -%}{%- endif -%}
  {%- capture slugs -%}{%- for tag in post.tags -%}{{ tag | slugify }}{%- unless forloop.last -%}|{%- endunless -%}{%- endfor -%}{%- endcapture -%}
  {%- capture questions -%}{%- for q in post.exercise.questions -%}{{ q.q }} {{ q.explain }} {% endfor -%}{%- endcapture -%}
  {%- capture text -%}{{ post.content | strip_html }} {{ questions }}{%- endcapture -%}
  {%- capture card -%}{% include post-card.html post=post heading="h2" %}{%- endcapture -%}
{
  "url": {{ post.url | relative_url | jsonify }},
  "title": {{ post.title | jsonify }},
  "desc": {{ post.description | jsonify }},
  "tags": {{ post.tags | jsonify }},
  "slugs": {{ slugs | jsonify }},
  "level": {{ post.level | jsonify }},
  "type": {{ kind | jsonify }},
  "date": {{ post.date | date: '%Y-%m-%d' | jsonify }},
  "text": {{ text | normalize_whitespace | jsonify }},
  "card": {{ card | normalize_whitespace | jsonify }}
}{%- unless forloop.last -%},{%- endunless -%}
{%- endfor -%}
]
